note Trigger in the document: the step header is header text with the STEP_HEADER id numbered by the step's slot. A click on a step of the tour being read queues SelectStep with Scrolling::Stay, so the page does not jump under the pointer; a click on a step shown inline under a link queues Scroll, because that step opens in its own tour.

