note Trigger in the steps list: every row is a STEP_LIST_ROW numbered by step slot, marked when it is the selection or the topmost step visible in the document. A click queues SelectStep with Scrolling::Scroll and GrabStep, which becomes a drag when the pointer travels (feature-move-step).

